<.focus_box>
  <:title>Traffic Sources & AI Referrals</:title>

  <div class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-['Arbutus_Slab',Georgia,serif] text-[#8b5cf6] mb-6">
      See which traffic — including AI — actually buys
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)] mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Customers find stores through search, social, email — and increasingly AI assistants.
      Qusto connects each source to orders and revenue, so you spend time where it pays.
    </p>
  </div>
  
<!-- The Problem -->
  <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 rounded-xl p-8 mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-['Arbutus_Slab',Georgia,serif] text-amber-900 mb-4">
      ⚠️ The Problem with Traditional Analytics
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)] mb-4">
      Google Analytics and other traditional platforms lump AI search traffic into "direct" or
      "unknown" sources. You're flying blind on one of the fastest-growing traffic sources.
    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
      Research shows <strong>63.6% of businesses</strong>
      now receive traffic from AI search engines.
      Are you tracking it?
    </p>
  </div>
  
<!-- What We Track -->
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-['Arbutus_Slab',Georgia,serif] text-[var(--color-heading)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-heading)] mb-6">
      AI Search Engines We Track
    </h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-[#10b981] shadow-md dark:shadow-warm">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-3 text-center">🤖</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)] mb-2">
          ChatGPT
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)] text-center text-sm">
          OpenAI's ChatGPT search and web browsing features
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-[#3b82f6] shadow-md dark:shadow-warm">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-3 text-center">🔍</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)] mb-2">
          Perplexity
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)] text-center text-sm">
          Perplexity AI search engine referrals
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-[#8b5cf6] shadow-md dark:shadow-warm">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-3 text-center">✨</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)] mb-2">
          Claude
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)] text-center text-sm">
          Anthropic's Claude with web search capabilities
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
<!-- Insights You'll Get -->
  <div class="bg-[#eeece2] dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-base)] rounded-xl p-8 mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-['Arbutus_Slab',Georgia,serif] text-[var(--color-heading)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-heading)] mb-6">
      Insights You'll Unlock
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4 border-[#8b5cf6]">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)] mb-2">
          📊 AI Search Traffic Volume
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
          See exactly how many visitors come from AI search engines vs traditional search
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4 border-[#8b5cf6]">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)] mb-2">
          🎯 Conversion Rates by Source
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
          Compare how AI search visitors convert vs Google, social media, and direct traffic
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4 border-[#8b5cf6]">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)] mb-2">
          💰 Revenue Attribution
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
          Track revenue from ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Claude referrals
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4 border-[#8b5cf6]">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)] mb-2">
          📈 Trend Analysis
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
          See how AI search traffic is growing over time and adjust your strategy
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
<!-- Real Results -->
  <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[var(--color-dark-bg-card)] rounded-xl p-8 mb-12 border-2 border-[#10b981]">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-['Arbutus_Slab',Georgia,serif] text-[#10b981] mb-6">
      Real Results from Early Adopters
    </h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-[#f0fdf4] rounded-lg p-6">
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-[#10b981] mb-2">18%</div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
          of traffic from ChatGPT for a French fashion e-commerce store
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#f0fdf4] rounded-lg p-6">
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-[#10b981] mb-2">€4,200</div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
          monthly revenue from AI search traffic for a German tech store
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
<!-- Why It Matters -->
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-['Arbutus_Slab',Georgia,serif] text-[var(--color-heading)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-heading)] mb-6">
      Why AI Search Tracking Matters for E-commerce
    </h2>
    <ul class="space-y-4">
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-[#10b981] mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)]">
            Optimize for AI Search:
          </strong>
          <span class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
            Understand which products and content AI search engines recommend
          </span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-[#10b981] mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)]">
            Attribution Accuracy:
          </strong>
          <span class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
            Stop losing AI traffic in "direct" or "unknown" buckets
          </span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-[#10b981] mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)]">
            Future-Proof Strategy:
          </strong>
          <span class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
            AI search is growing rapidly—be ready for the shift
          </span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-[#10b981] mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-primary)]">
            Competitive Advantage:
          </strong>
          <span class="text-gray-600 dark:text-[var(--color-dark-text-secondary)]">
            You'll see AI search trends before your competitors do
          </span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  
<!-- Privacy Note -->
  <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-xl p-6 mb-12">
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-2">🔒 Privacy-First AI Tracking</h3>
    <p class="text-blue-800">
      Just like all Qusto tracking, AI search detection is <strong>100% privacy-compliant</strong>.
      No cookies, no personal data, no user tracking. We detect the referrer source, not the individual.
    </p>
  </div>

  <:footer>
    <.focus_list>
      <:item>
        <.styled_link href={Routes.auth_path(@conn, :register_form)}>
          Start Tracking AI Search →
        </.styled_link>
      </:item>
      <:item>
        <.styled_link href="/pricing">
          View Pricing
        </.styled_link>
      </:item>
    </.focus_list>
  </:footer>
</.focus_box>
